# Illustrative AHU fixture only — not a live site model.
# Device instance 10001 (IllustrativeAHU): SAT AI:12, RAT AI:13, MAT AI:14, OAT AI:15,
# SF status BI:1, SF speed cmd AO:1, CHW valve AO:2, HW valve AO:3, OA damper AO:4,
# SAT setpoint AV:1 (optional bacnet:priority-for-writing 16).
# Each point has s223:hasExternalReference to an s223:BACnetExternalReference
# (ASHRAE 223P 2nd public review draft, section 11.18.1).

@prefix bacnet: <http://data.ashrae.org/bacnet/2020#> .
@prefix bacnet2024: <http://data.ashrae.org/bacnet/2024#> .
